  "title": "Air-Fried Peruvian Chicken Drumsticks with Green Crema",
  "description": "A tasty green crema made with spinach, sour cream, zesty lime, cilantro, and jalapeño is served over air-fried, Peruvian-style chicken drumsticks.",
